{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the tense final days of World War II, I.O.P<strong>\u00a0</strong>is a gritty, story-driven stealth game where players embark on a dangerous mission behind enemy lines. With the Nazi regime collapsing, high-ranking officers have gone into hiding\u2014rumors swirl that Adolf Hitler himself may have escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a specially trained Allied operative, your mission is to infiltrate remnants of the Nazi war machine scattered across war-torn Europe. From abandoned bunkers to snowy forests and epic scenes, you\u2019ll use stealth, deception, and precision to uncover hidden clues, track Hitler, and dismantle what\u2019s left of a dying empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter matters. Use disguises, sabotage, and silent takedowns to avoid detection.\u00a0 Can you save the world from Hitler?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcometo1946","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"Saboteur Rising","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"Resident Spooky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"Shaken, not Stirred","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"Looking out my back door!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"No Paper Trails","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d777627eeb6e0a9ee5ef88b121eae6791535.jpg"},{"name":"Rolling Along","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3829440/a287d77